From 27347975ab828c39a4ec5259cb1924812396b169 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Troy Sargent <0xalpharush@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(refinement): transfer gas bound from any caller

Proves a gas bound G = 8199112 for UniswapV2ERC20.transfer on its
exact runtime bytes, from every caller below 2^160 but the contract.
The checker with contexts and gas (checkXL) accepts the bytes against
the final EVM IR evm11 with every block outside transfer's slice left
unchecked; a symbolic guard stage shows no transfer call enters those
blocks. The forward theorem is generalized to any CALLER
(runWithFrom, forward_of_checkXLFrom) and composed into
Shapes.ResourcesFrom, which gives Shapes.Resources at callerAddress.
Generated inputs (stages, certificate) come from
scripts/verify/uniswap_v2_gas.sh and are not committed.
